{
    "chapter_num": 19,
    "verses_count": 42,
    "paragraphs_list": [
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "The Soldiers Mock Jesus"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 1,
                    "num_str": "1",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So then Pilate took Jesus and scourged "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "Him."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 2,
                    "num_str": "2",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And the soldiers twisted a crown of thorns and put "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "it"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " on His head, and they put on Him a purple robe. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 3,
                    "num_str": "3",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU And they came up to Him and said"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then they said, “Hail, King of the Jews!” And they struck Him with their hands."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 4,
                    "num_str": "4",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Pilate then went out again, and said to them, “Behold, I am bringing Him out to you, that you may know that I find no fault in Him.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Pilate’s Decision"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 5,
                    "num_str": "5",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then Jesus came out, wearing the crown of thorns and the purple robe. And "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "Pilate"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " said to them, “Behold the Man!”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 6,
                    "num_str": "6",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Therefore, when the chief priests and officers saw Him, they cried out, saying, “Crucify "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "Him,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " crucify "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "Him!"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "”"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Pilate said to them, “You take Him and crucify "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "Him,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " for I find no fault in Him.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 7,
                    "num_str": "7",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "The Jews answered him, “We have a law, and according to "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU the law"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "our law He ought to die, because He made Himself the Son of God.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 8,
                    "num_str": "8",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Therefore, when Pilate heard that saying, he was the more afraid, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 9,
                    "num_str": "9",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "and went again into the Praetorium, and said to Jesus, “Where are You from?” But Jesus gave him no answer."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 10,
                    "num_str": "10",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then Pilate said to Him, “Are You not speaking to me? Do You not know that I have "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "authority"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "power to crucify You, and power to release You?”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 11,
                    "num_str": "11",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Jesus answered, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "“You could have no power at all against Me unless it had been given you from above. Therefore"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "the one who delivered Me to you has the greater sin.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 12,
                    "num_str": "12",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "From then on Pilate sought to release Him, but the Jews cried out, saying, “If you let this Man go, you are not Caesar’s friend. Whoever makes himself a king speaks against Caesar.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 13,
                    "num_str": "13",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "When Pilate therefore heard that saying, he brought Jesus out and sat down in the judgment seat in a place that is called "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "The"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " Pavement, but in Hebrew, Gabbatha. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 14,
                    "num_str": "14",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now it was the Preparation Day of the Passover, and about the sixth hour. And he said to the Jews, “Behold your King!”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 15,
                    "num_str": "15",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But they cried out, “Away with "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "Him,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " away with "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "Him!"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " Crucify Him!”"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Pilate said to them, “Shall I crucify your King?”"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "The chief priests answered, “We have no king but Caesar!”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 16,
                    "num_str": "16",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then he delivered Him to them to be crucified. Then they took Jesus "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU omits and led Him away"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "and led "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "Him"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " away."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "The King on a Cross"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 17,
                    "num_str": "17",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And He, bearing His cross, went out to a place called "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "the Place"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " of a Skull, which is called in Hebrew, Golgotha, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 18,
                    "num_str": "18",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "where they crucified Him, and two others with Him, one on either side, and Jesus in the center. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 19,
                    "num_str": "19",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now Pilate wrote a title and put "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "it"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " on the cross. And the writing was:"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "JESUS OF NAZARETH, THE KING OF THE JEWS."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 20,
                    "num_str": "20",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then many of the Jews read this title, for the place where Jesus was crucified was near the city; and it was written in Hebrew, Greek, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "and"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " Latin."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 21,
                    "num_str": "21",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Therefore the chief priests of the Jews said to Pilate, “Do not write, ‘The King of the Jews,’ but, ‘He said, “I am the King of the Jews.” ’ ”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 22,
                    "num_str": "22",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Pilate answered, “What I have written, I have written.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 23,
                    "num_str": "23",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then the soldiers, when they had crucified Jesus, took His garments and made four parts, to each soldier a part, and also the tunic. Now the tunic was without seam, woven from the top in one piece. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 24,
                    "num_str": "24",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "They said therefore among themselves, “Let us not tear it, but cast lots for it, whose it shall be,” that the Scripture might be fulfilled which says:"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "“They divided My garments among them,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "And for My clothing they cast lots.”"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Therefore the soldiers did these things."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Behold Your Mother"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 25,
                    "num_str": "25",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now there stood by the cross of Jesus His mother, and His mother’s sister, Mary the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "wife"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " of Clopas, and Mary Magdalene. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 26,
                    "num_str": "26",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "When Jesus therefore saw His mother, and the disciple whom He loved standing by, He said to His mother, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "“Woman, behold your son!”"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 27,
                    "num_str": "27",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then He said to the disciple, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "“Behold your mother!”"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " And from that hour that disciple took her to his own "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "home."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "It Is Finished"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 28,
                    "num_str": "28",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "After this, Jesus, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "M seeing"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "knowing that all things were now accomplished, that the Scripture might be fulfilled, said, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "“I thirst!”"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 29,
                    "num_str": "29",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now a vessel full of sour wine was sitting there; and they filled a sponge with sour wine, put "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "it"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " on hyssop, and put "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "it"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " to His mouth. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 30,
                    "num_str": "30",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So when Jesus had received the sour wine, He said, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "“It is finished!”"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " And bowing His head, He gave up His spirit."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Jesus’ Side Is Pierced"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 31,
                    "num_str": "31",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Therefore, because it was the Preparation "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "Day,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " that the bodies should not remain on the cross on the Sabbath (for that Sabbath was a high day), the Jews asked Pilate that their legs might be broken, and "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "that"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " they might be taken away. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 32,
                    "num_str": "32",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then the soldiers came and broke the legs of the first and of the other who was crucified with Him. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 33,
                    "num_str": "33",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But when they came to Jesus and saw that He was already dead, they did not break His legs. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 34,
                    "num_str": "34",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But one of the soldiers pierced His side with a spear, and immediately blood and water came out. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 35,
                    "num_str": "35",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And he who has seen has testified, and his testimony is true; and he knows that he is telling the truth, so that you may believe. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 36,
                    "num_str": "36",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For these things were done that the Scripture should be fulfilled, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "“Not"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "one"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "of His bones shall be broken.”"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 37,
                    "num_str": "37",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And again another Scripture says, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "“They shall look on Him whom they pierced.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Jesus Buried in Joseph’s Tomb"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 38,
                    "num_str": "38",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "After this, Joseph of Arimathea, being a disciple of Jesus, but secretly, for fear of the Jews, asked Pilate that he might take away the body of Jesus; and Pilate gave "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "him"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " permission. So he came and took the body of Jesus. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 39,
                    "num_str": "39",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And Nicodemus, who at first came to Jesus by night, also came, bringing a mixture of myrrh and aloes, about a hundred pounds. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 40,
                    "num_str": "40",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then they took the body of Jesus, and bound it in strips of linen with the spices, as the custom of the Jews is to bury. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 41,
                    "num_str": "41",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now in the place where He was crucified there was a garden, and in the garden a new tomb in which no one had yet been laid. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 42,
                    "num_str": "42",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So there they laid Jesus, because of the Jews’ Preparation "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "Day,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " for the tomb was nearby."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}